== Notes ==

* In addition to the fortitude save upon entering the cloud (to resist the movement speed decrease), fortitude saves are also made each round a target is inside the acid fog. However, these extra saves serve no purpose; there is no difference between passing and failing them.
* Damage is rolled once each round, not once per target.

